# Code owners.
#
# Every pull request needs a review, and branch protection requires it to come
# from the owner of the area being changed. Ownership follows the four areas of
# responsibility in docs/collaboration-plan.md, so the person who knows an area
# is requested automatically.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ACTION REQUIRED WHEN THE TEAM JOINS THE REPOSITORY
#
# Every path below currently points at @SimonMutyavaviri, because the other
# three members do not yet have write access. An entry naming a user who cannot
# access the repository is ignored by GitHub, which would silently leave those
# paths unowned.
#
# As each teammate is added (Settings -> Collaborators -> Add people, with
# Write access), replace the owner on their section with their real handle:
#
#   Student 1 -> authentication and user management
#   Student 2 -> qualification management
#   Student 3 -> verification and audit
#   Student 4 -> DevOps, QA and deployment
#
# Check your edit with:
#   gh api repos/SimonMutyavaviri/qualification-verification-system/codeowners/errors
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

